&P354561 = ARM 26, 004 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya 
#tr.en: To my lord 
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: qibima 
#tr.en: speak! 
3. um-ma la-u2-um _ARAD2_-ka-a-ma 
#tr.ts: umma la’um waradkama 
#tr.en: thus La’um, your servant: 
4. {disz}as3-qu2-du-um _masz2-szu-gid2-gid2_ 
#tr.ts: asqudum bārûm 
#tr.en: Asqudum, the diviner, 
5. isz-tu ma-ha-ar _lugal_ 
#tr.ts: ištu maḫar šarrim 
#tr.en: from before the king 
6. il-li-ka-am 
#tr.ts: illikām 
#tr.en: came to me. 
7. a-szar id-bu-bu ma-da-tim-ma id-bu-ub 
#tr.ts: ašar idbubu madātimma idbub 
#tr.en: Where he talked, many things he talked. 
8. [a-na] a-ia-szi-im iq-bu-nim 
#tr.ts: ana ayyâšim iqbûnim 
#tr.en: To me they said so. 
9. [ka]-ar#-s,i2-ia 
#tr.ts: karṣīya 
#tr.en: Slander of me, 
10. [ka-ar-s,i2] {d}suen-i-di2-nam 
#tr.ts: karṣī sîn-iddinam 
#tr.en: slander of Sîn-Iddinam 
