# he fed the king slander of me, ... 
3. ma#-am-ma-an i-na qa-ti-szu 
#tr.ts: mamman ina qātišu 
#tr.en: No one in his hand 
4. u2-ul sza-lim a-na s,e-er# be-li2-ia 
